ype": "step-start", "id": "prt_136629e4f00114Hmvg3spzX9dF", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136627e02001vBkeQ46zl2GPax"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The APK is 103 MB — larger than expected! The asset inside APK is `71,110,950` bytes — stored UNCOMPRESSED in the APK! The `unzip -l` shows size but I need to see compressed size. Let me check: `unzip -l` shows uncompressed sizes. The output shows `71110950` for ru_wordlist.txt. So the APK did NOT compress the .txt asset. Why? Because of `noCompress`? The app's `androidResources { noCompress.addAll(listOf(\"tflite\", \"bin\")) }` only adds those. Hmm, but AGP might have a default that includes txt? Actually wait — modern AGP default is that assets are NOT compressed? No...\n\nActually, APK 103MB vs expected ~25MB. So the 71MB asset is stored uncompressed → APK ~ 71MB + rest ~32MB = 103MB. That's worse than the original 87MB! Because the original DEX (compressed in APK zip) was maybe ~65MB uncompressed but compressed to ~? Hmm, wait. The original v2.0.0 APK install size was 87MB (that's the compressed APK file size as passed to openWrite? Actually openWrite size = APK file size). So original APK file was ~87MB. Now 103MB — WORSE. Because the .txt is stored uncompressed in the zip.\n\nSo AGP is not compressing .txt assets. Why? Let me recall: AGP's default `noCompress` list... Actually since AGP 4.2, the default `noCompress` might be empty and assets ARE compressed. But here it's clearly not compressed. Perhaps because this project has `android.enableR8...` no. Or AGP changed default to NOT compress assets? Hmm.\n\nWait, let me actually check the compressed size inside the zip: `unzip -v` shows both. Let me verify. But APK total 103MB strongly suggests uncompressed storage of the 71MB asset (deflate of 68MB russian text would be ~9MB; then APK would be ~32MB).\n\nLet me check with `unzip -v`. If stored, I need to force compression via `androidResources { noCompress.remove(\"txt\") }`? But txt isn't in noCompress. Hmm.\n\nActually — modern AGP (8.x) changed asset packaging: I recall that AGP 8 defaults to NOT compressing assets? No... Let me just check the zip.\n\nActually, the real reason might be: AGP automatically doesn't compress assets with extensions in a default list. Historically the default noCompress list included: `jpg, jpeg, png, gif, wav, mp2, mp3, ogg, aac, mpg, mpeg, mid, midi, smf, jet, rtttl, imy, xmf, mp4, m4a, m4v, 3gp, 3gpp, 3g2, 3gpp2, amr, awb, wma, wmv, webm, mkv`. `.txt` NOT there. So should compress.\n\nUnless... AGP 8+ uses a different mechanism: assets are compressed unless the file is already compressed or `noCompress`. Hmm.\n\nWait — maybe the issue is that the file is inside a **library** module asset and gets merged; the app packaging might store library assets uncompressed? Unlikely.\n\nLet me check the actual APK entry compression method. Let me run `unzip -v`.\n\nAlso there's `android.enableR8.fullMode=false` etc. Not relevant.\n\nLet me inspect. Then fix by explicitly ensuring compression:\n- Option: rename to `.bin`? No, app noCompress includes bin → worse.\n- Use `androidResources { noCompress.remove(\"txt\") }` won't help if it's not in list.\n- Explicitly: AGP has `packaging { resources { ... } }` and `androidResources { noCompress... }`. To force compression of assets, there is no direct \"compress\" option; but aapt2 does compress by default. Hmm.\n\nActually! I recall AGP behavior: **assets are stored uncompressed if their extension is in `noCompress`, otherwise compressed**. BUT there's a known quirk: AGP's default noCompress includes `txt`? Let me check gradle/build-logic for defaults.\n\nLet me inspect the zip and gradle config. Let me also check `gradle/build-logic` for androidResources defaults.\n\nLet me run unzip -v.", "time": {"start": 1791913795200, "end": 1791913802152}, "id": "prt_136629e80001oBycuge51mAofN", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_136627e02001vBkeQ46zl2GPax"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_00_jhz4pnqa5n9ywsr3itwwerky", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "unzip -v app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk | grep -i \"ru_wordlist\\|Length\\|Defl\"; echo \"---apk summary---\"; unzip -v app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk | grep -iE \"classes.*dex|resources.arsc\" | head; echo \"---total compressed vs uncompressed---\"; unzip -v app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-arm64-v8a-debug.apk | awk 'NR>3 && NF>=8 {u+=$2; c+=$3} END{printf \"uncompressed=%.1f MB compressed=%.1f MB\\n\", u/1048576, c/1048576}'"}, "output": "...output truncated...\n\nFull output saved to: /home/runner/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_13662bdb00014ExFenkb8WPU9L\n\n     992  Defl:N      410  59% 1981-01-01 01:01 ade779c9  res/layout/complex_fixed_expand.xml\n    1040  Defl:N      415  60% 1981-01-01 01:01 0cbbbe9a  res/layout/complex_fixed_fixed.xml\n     948  Defl:N      391  59% 1981-01-01 01:01 54b1bd15  res/layout/complex_fixed_match.xml\n     948  Defl:N      386  59% 1981-01-01 01:01 cbcff2b4  res/layout/complex_fixed_wrap.xml\n     596  Defl:N      296  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 296666f2  res/layout/complex_match_expand.xml\n     948  Defl:N      392  59% 1981-01-01 01:01 50d29493  res/layout/complex_match_fixed.xml\n     552  Defl:N      276  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 da2528e7  res/layout/complex_match_match.xml\n     552  Defl:N      278  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 a4fdcd75  res/layout/complex_match_wrap.xml\n     596  Defl:N      298  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 855f113b  res/layout/complex_wrap_expand.xml\n     948  Defl:N      385  59% 1981-01-01 01:01 f1352295  res/layout/complex_wrap_fixed.xml\n     552  Defl:N      279  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 5c4f28a4  res/layout/complex_wrap_match.xml\n     552  Defl:N      277  50% 1981-01-01 01:01 2297cd36  res/layout/complex_wrap_wrap.xml\n     612  Defl:N      311  49% 1981-01-01 01:01 241b34b1  res/layout/custom_dialog.xml\n    1860  Defl:N      672  64%